WHAT THIS COVERS

This repository contains sample output from a generative engine, in three groups, plus the
accompanying documentation. The groups are treated differently and the difference matters.

  1. SAMPLES — samples/sigils/, samples/sigils-black/, samples/contact-sheet.svg, and the WAV
     files under samples/audio/.

  2. OPEN SET — the 100 SVG files under samples/open-set/. Generated from seeds reserved for
     publication; they belong to no set offered for sale.

  3. GALLERY — the raster images under samples/gallery/. These DEPICT pieces that are not
     published here and are not licensed by this document. They are provided so the engine's
     output can be seen at scale, for viewing only. No right to use, extract, trace, reproduce
     or redistribute the depicted pieces is granted by their appearance in these images, and no
     such right may be inferred from it.

The engine itself is not published here and is not covered by this license.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

Groups 1 and 2: you may view, download and study these files. You may reference them in
commentary, review or discussion of this work, with attribution to Nthnkr "dpna" and AmandaBT and
a link to this repository.

Group 3: you may view these images and reference them in commentary, review or discussion of this
work, on the same attribution terms. Nothing further.

PROVENANCE

Files in groups 1 and 2 carry their origin inside them, in more than one form. Removing the
visible parts does not make a file anonymous, and does not affect the terms below.

